Once again I send something to netfilter-devel and start getting
spam.  I know it's due to this list cause it's to this address which
I use for only this mailing list.
And this is not the first time.  In fact I'm on my 5th address for 
this list.  I don't have this problem with my other lists.

Well, time to invalidate this address and resubscribe under a new one.
For those several people who recently contacted me at this address,
I'm sorry - you'll have to negotiate my spam filter again.
(Which you can do by sending mail to this address.)

For the future, can something be done about this?  
